The "Starting Faction Standing" guide provides a comprehensive overview of the initial faction standings for characters in Everquest. This guide details how a character’s [[race | '''RACE''']], [[class | '''CLASS''']], and chosen [[deities | '''DEITY''']] influence their relationships with the major [[faction | factions]] across Norrath. Whether you're navigating the complex political landscape of city-states or simply trying to avoid hostile guards, understanding your starting faction standing is essential for every new adventurer. This resource allows players to plan their journey more effectively by offering insights into which factions will view them favorably—or with hostility—from the moment they enter the game.


'''Contributions are welcome! Please ensure that all entries reflect initial standings only. If [[illusions | ILLUSIONS]] or other effects are used to alter race, please update the race accordingly to reflect the change.'''


==Norrath==
Norrath is a vast and intricate world where numerous factions transcend the boundaries of individual cities or continents. These global factions wield influence across multiple regions, and a player's interactions with them can affect their standing in distant lands, regardless of their origin. Some of these factions are tied to religious orders, powerful guilds, or wide-reaching organizations with a presence in various cities.

