===[[Grobb]]===
Grobb is the home city of the Trolls, located in the southern swamps of Antonica. As a stronghold of the Troll race, Grobb's factions reflect its brutish and warlike nature. Characters aligned with Grobb can expect favorable treatment from its inhabitants, but outsiders—especially those of certain races and classes—will likely face hostility.

