===[[Neriak]]===
Neriak, the capital of the Teir'Dal (Dark Elves), is a sprawling underground city divided into three distinct zones: Neriak Foreign Quarter, Neriak Commons, and Neriak Third Gate. Each zone represents a deeper and more secure part of the city, with increasing restrictions on who can enter. The city is home to various factions that govern its social and political life.

