===[[Oggok]]===
Oggok, the stronghold of the Ogre race, is located in the southwestern swamps of Antonica. As a city controlled by the brutish Ogres, it harbors a handful of factions that reflect their militaristic and primal culture. The main factions in Oggok are largely concerned with maintaining order and strength within the Ogre community, while also keeping outsiders—particularly "good-aligned" races—at bay.

