==Odus==
Odus, the remote continent inhabited primarily by the Erudites, is home to unique factions that play a significant role in shaping its political and social structure. However, several factions on Odus extend beyond the borders of the continent, influencing relationships with characters from other regions of Norrath.
<br>
===[[Erudin]]===
Erudin, the capital city of the Erudites, is a hub of intellectualism and magical study located on the western island of Odus. Governed by a scholarly and peaceful society, Erudin is home to several influential factions that shape the city's structure and politics.

