==Kunark==
Kunark is a dangerous and untamed continent, home to various powerful factions that are not bound by any particular city or landmass, making them unique in Norrath’s complex political and social landscape. The factions found in Kunark often represent ancient empires, warring tribes, and primal forces, each vying for dominance over this vast and wild continent. 
<br>
===[[Cabilis]]===
Cabilis, the city of the Iksar, is a fortified stronghold located in the southeastern part of Kunark. As the central hub for Iksar players, the city is home to several major factions that govern the different aspects of Iksar society.

